  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Portfolio on community resilience with a triple nexus approach in Venezuela</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the framework of the inter-agency Community Resilience Portfolio with a Nexus approach in Venezuela UNHCR - FAO - UNDP, 13 initiatives have been designed to be implemented jointly by the 3 agencies, with FAO leading 3 of them and supporting the implementation and supervision of the remaining 12.

The interventions will be carried out in different geographic zones and areas of expertise, which is why this agreement will regulate the co-management of the Portfolio in the activities for which UNHCR will be responsible or co-responsible.
	
Each intervention has a descriptive document that guides the jointly defined action plan.</narrative>
  </description>
